{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-86-1","title":"Psalms 86:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David strengthens his prayer by the consciousness of his religion; 5 by the goodness and power of God. 11 He desires the continuance of former grace. 14 Complaining of the proud, he craves some token of God's goodness.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A Prayer of David. or a prayer, being a Psalm ofDavid. This Psalm is supposed to have been composed by David either when persecuted by Saul, or driven from Jerusalem by Absalom.</p>\n<p>102:1; 142:1; *titles Bow. 31:2; Isa 37:17; Da 9:18 for I am. 10:14; 34:6; 40:17; 72:12-14; 102:17; 119:22; 140:12; Isa 66:2 Mt 5:3; Lu 4:18; Jas 1:9,10; 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-2","title":"Psalms 86:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Preserve. 4:3; 37:28; 119:94; 1Sa 2:9; Joh 10:27-29; 17:11; 1Pe 5:3-5 holy. or, one whom thou favourest. 18:19; De 7:7,8; Ro 9:18,23,24 save. 119:124,125; 143:12; Joh 12:26 trusteth. 13:5; 16:1; 31:1; Isa 26:3,4; Ro 15:12,13; Eph 1:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-3","title":"Psalms 86:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Be merciful. 56:1; 57:1 for I. 55:17; 88:9; Lu 2:37; 11:8-13; 18:7; Eph 6:18 daily. or, all the day. 25:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-4","title":"Psalms 86:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Rejoice. 51:12; Isa 61:3; 65:18; 66:13,14 do. 25:1; 62:8; 143:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-5","title":"Psalms 86:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thou. 15; 25:8; 36:7; 52:1; 69:16; 119:68; 130:7; 145:8,9; Ex 34:6; Joe 2:13 1Jo 4:8,9 ready. Ne 9:17; Isa 55:7; Da 9:9; Mic 7:18 plenteous. 103:8; 130:4,7; Joe 2:13; Ro 5:20,21; Eph 1:6-8; 2:4 unto all. 145:18; Jer 33:3; Eze 36:33,37; Lu 11:9,10; Joh 4:10; Ac 2:21 Ro 10:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-6","title":"Psalms 86:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>5:1,2; 17:1; 130:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-7","title":"Psalms 86:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>18:6; 34:4-6; 50:15; 55:16-18; 77:1,2; 91:15; 142:1,3; Isa 26:16 La 3:55-57; Jon 2:2; Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-8","title":"Psalms 86:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Among. 89:6,8; Ex 15:11; Isa 40:18,25; Jer 10:6,7,16; Da 3:29 neither. 136:4; De 3:24; 4:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-9","title":"Psalms 86:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>All. 22:27-31; 66:4; 67:7; 72:8,19; 102:15,18; Isa 2:2-4; 11:9; 43:7 Isa 59:19; 66:23; Zec 14:9; Ro 11:25; Re 11:15; 15:4; 20:3 glorify. Ro 15:9; Eph 1:12; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-10","title":"Psalms 86:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>For. 8; 72:18; 77:14,15; 145:3-5; Ex 15:11; Job 11:7; Da 6:26,27 Ac 2:19-22; 4:30; Ro 15:18,19; Heb 2:4 God. De 6:3,4; 32:39; Isa 37:16,20; 44:6-8; Mr 12:29; 1Co 8:4; Eph 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-11","title":"Psalms 86:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Teach. 5:8; 25:4,12; 27:11; 119:33,73; 143:8-10; Job 34:32; Joh 6:45,46 Eph 4:21 I will. 26:3; 119:30; Mal 2:6; 2Jo 1:4; 3Jo 1:3,4 unite. Jer 32:38,39; Ho 10:2; 14:8; Zep 1:5; Mt 6:22-24; Joh 17:20,21 Ac 2:46; 1Co 6:17; 10:21; 2Co 11:3; Col 3:17,22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-12","title":"Psalms 86:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>praise. 34:1; 103:1-3; 104:33; 145:1-5; 146:1,2; 1Ch 29:13,20; Isa 12:1 Re 5:9-13; 19:5,6 with all. 9:1; De 6:5; Pr 3:5,6; Ac 8:37; Eph 5:19 glorify. Ro 15:6; 1Co 6:20; 10:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-13","title":"Psalms 86:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>great. 57:10; 103:8-12; 108:4; Lu 1:58 and thou. 16:10; 56:13; 88:6; 116:8; Job 33:18,22,24,28; Isa 38:17; Jon 2:3-6 1Th 1:10 hell. or, grave.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-14","title":"Psalms 86:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>O God. 36:11; 54:3; 119:51,69,85; 140:5; 2Sa 15:1-12 assemblies. 2Sa 16:20-23; 17:1,14; Mt 26:3,4; 27:1,2; Ac 4:27,28 violent. Heb. terrible. and have. 10:4,11,13; 14:4; 36:1; Eze 8:12; 9:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-15","title":"Psalms 86:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>But thou. 5; 103:8; 111:4; 130:4,7; 145:8; Ex 31:6,7; Nu 14:18; Ne 9:17 Joe 2:13; Mic 7:18; Ro 5:20,21; Eph 1:7; 2:4-7 mercy. 85:10; 98:3; Joh 1:17; Ro 15:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-16","title":"Psalms 86:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>turn. 25:16; 69:16; 90:13; 119:132 give. 28:7,8; 84:5; 138:3; Isa 40:29-31; 45:24; Zec 10:12; Eph 3:16; 6:10 Php 4:13; Col 1:11 the son 116:16; 119:94; Lu 1:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-86-17","title":"Psalms 86:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":86,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":86,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Shew. 41:10,11; 74:9; Isa 38:22; 1Co 5:5 that they. 71:9-13; 109:29; Mic 7:8-10 thou. 40:1; 71:20,21</p>"}]}